press-start-2p-v15-latin-regular.woff2 in this directory is a subset of
the upstream PressStart2P-Regular.ttf (google/fonts, ofl/pressstart2p),
built with fonttools/pyftsubset and limited to the glyphs this site
actually renders (basic ASCII plus em dash, right arrow, and the four
triangle glyphs used by the d-pad and section markers). Subsetting is
permitted by the OFL as a modification; this notice and OFL.txt travel
with the font per section 3 of the license. No characters were added or
redrawn — this is strictly a glyph-coverage reduction of the original.

Self-hosted here (no runtime request to any font CDN) so the site's
Content-Security-Policy can set font-src 'self'.
